		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4607&amp;p=34199#p34199"><![CDATA[
There is nothing special about DMO mode. TG filtering is the same as for RMO. <br><br>The default settings for the DMR filter is Off. So you will hear all talkgroups. <br>If you want to only hear one TG then set the DMR filter to TG. <br><br>Colin G4EML<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=87">G4EML</a> — Sun Nov 24, 2024 5:15 pm</p><hr />
